  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monsoon Floods 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Current IFRC DREF is supporting 1,200 households &#x2013; only in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar for host communities. If the DREF value is increased to CHF 1 million, they will reach additional 2,500 households in other locations. This is currently being discussed with IFRC as the initial DREF is developed based only on Cox&#x2019;s Bazar humanitarian needs.&#xa0;


&#xa0;


BRC intends to support to 5,000 of the total 20,000 affected households targeted for multipurpose cash assistance. Part of the emergency funds allocated in BRC Locally Led Response grant will support 1,250 households. The DF will compliment and support additional 3,750 households. This represents 25% of total cash assistance target for the response.&#xa0;


&#xa0;


A portion of the DF will be utilized to support beneficiary selection process and post distribution monitoring to ensure quality data and human stories are effectively captured.</narrative>
  </description>
